# Supabase Edge Functions run in the Deno runtime, not the Expo/TS app bundle.
# They use Deno-only globals (Deno.env) and npm:/relative Deno import specifiers
# that the app's oxlint/tsc config does not understand. They are linted/type-
# checked by the Deno toolchain instead, so exclude them from the app gates.
supabase/functions/
